WEBVTT

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.191
and software innovation

00:09:31.191 --> 00:09:36.739
to be about surpassing
what humans can see and perceive.

00:09:38.115 --> 00:09:41.243
We’ve made a lot of progress
in this field,

00:09:41.243 --> 00:09:42.494
but at the end of the day,

00:09:42.494 --> 00:09:43.787
we have a lot more to do.

00:09:44.246 --> 00:09:46.332
And with an autonomous robotaxi,

00:09:46.332 --> 00:09:47.916
you want it to be safe,

00:09:47.916 --> 00:09:51.128
right and reliable every single time,

00:09:51.128 --> 00:09:54.423
which requires rigorous testing
and optimization.

00:09:55.007 --> 00:09:56.425
And when that happens

00:09:56.425 --> 00:09:58.135
and we reach that state,

00:09:58.135 --> 00:10:01.889
we will wonder how we ever accepted